<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, minimal-ui">
    <title>Covering Letter</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/wdi-30-ldn/portfolio/favicon-32x32.png" sizes="32x32" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/wdi-30-ldn/portfolio/favicon-16x16.png" sizes="16x16" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.2.0/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha512-xh6O/CkQoPOWDdYTDqeRdPCVd1SpvCA9XXcUnZS2FmJNp1coAFzvtCN9BmamE+4aHK8yyUHUSCcJHgXloTyT2A==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../styles/main.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="covering-letter" class="page left-border">
      {{> covering-letter-header}}
      {{#coveringLetter.company}}

        <div class="covering-letter-content">
          <p>Dear {{hiringManager.name}},</p>

          <p>I am writing to apply for the {{position}} position{{#if companyKnown}} at {{name}}{{/if}}. I am a senior frontend engineer with 8+ years of experience building user-facing React and TypeScript products, and I would love to bring that product-focused engineering experience to your team.</p>

          <p>Across Alphero, Springload, and ITV, I have built products used by large audiences and collaborated closely with product, design, QA, and backend engineers to deliver high-quality outcomes. I have owned React and TypeScript features from planning and estimation through release, with a strong focus on maintainability, performance, accessibility, and reliable delivery.</p>

          {{!-- <p>I am at my best when turning complex requirements into practical technical plans and helping teams deliver steadily. I enjoy mentoring through code reviews and pairing, and I care about writing maintainable, well-tested code that works smoothly on constrained devices.</p> --}}

          {{#if examples}}
            <p>Examples of my achievements include:</p>
            <ul>
              {{#each examples}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/each}}
            </ul>
          {{/if}}

          {{#if reasonsWhyCompany}}
            <p>
              {{#each reasonsWhyCompany}}{{.}} {{/each}}
            </p>
          {{/if}}

          <p>Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my frontend engineering experience could contribute to your team.</p>

          <p>Sincerely,</p>

          <p>Wilson Espina</p>

          <br/>

        </div>
      {{/coveringLetter.company}}
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
